    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_01fe68bd3de25eb0f466",
      "document_start": 132,
      "document_end": 191,
      "text": "多柔体系统动力学主要研究“柔性效应”，即研究物体变形与其整体刚性运动的相互作用或耦合，以及这种耦合所导致的动力学效应。",
      "section_id": "section_21b2600cae29"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_501fc2afdaa70681ca85",
      "document_start": 191,
      "document_end": 223,
      "text": "它是多刚体系统动力学的延伸和发展，是分析力学、连续介质力学、多刚",
      "section_id": "section_21b2600cae29"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_a8dfbb89e5df9aa9df5d",
      "document_start": 225,
      "document_end": 245,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 2;",
      "section_id": "section_21b2600cae29"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_8892e66c5d76aaf68916",
      "document_start": 246,
      "document_end": 263,
      "text": "# 2.2.2 多柔体系统动力学;",
      "section_id": "section_21b2600cae29"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_ffd0a32ab70411e5f5a7",
      "document_start": 264,
      "document_end": 296,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_21b2600cae29"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_7fa23bcd8ac3b49a3529",
      "document_start": 298,
      "document_end": 318,
      "text": "体动力学、结构动力学学科发展交叉的必然。",
      "section_id": "section_21b2600cae29"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_455875540a101384b0cb",
      "document_start": 318,
      "document_end": 367,
      "text": "虽然柔性多体系统动力学模型可以退化为多刚体系统动力学模型和结构动力学模型，但并非是二者的简单结合。",
      "section_id": "section_21b2600cae29"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_39c534fe2be3e63827ea",
      "document_start": 367,
      "document_end": 392,
      "text": "当系统不经历大范围空间运动时，即为结构动力学方程；",
      "section_id": "section_21b2600cae29"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_8516fca3dba4f3012bfc",
      "document_start": 392,
      "document_end": 419,
      "text": "当各部件的变形可以忽略时，则变为多刚体系统动力学方程。",
