          "document_end": 977,
          "text": "# 2.2.2 多柔体系统动力学;",
          "section_id": "section_21b2600cae29",
          "start": 960,
          "end": 977,
          "chunk_start": 960,
          "chunk_end": 977,
          "sentence_document_start": 960,
          "sentence_document_end": 977,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_5cabc8853a04e106ec86",
          "document_start": 978,
          "document_end": 1010,
          "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
          "section_id": "section_21b2600cae29",
          "start": 978,
          "end": 1010,
          "chunk_start": 978,
          "chunk_end": 1010,
          "sentence_document_start": 978,
          "sentence_document_end": 1010,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_665d403c61aef940e67d",
          "document_start": 1012,
          "document_end": 1023,
          "text": "（2）变形的描述方式。",
          "section_id": "section_21b2600cae29",
          "start": 1012,
          "end": 1023,
          "chunk_start": 1012,
          "chunk_end": 1023,
          "sentence_document_start": 1012,
          "sentence_document_end": 1023,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_f8a25373f64fba62f0e7",
          "document_start": 1023,
          "document_end": 1104,
          "text": "柔体变形描述方式的数学模型，对建模和求解的难易程度影响很大，尤其是在采用空间模型或有限元方法的情况下，描述变形的弹性坐标数目的增加远远超过了参考系坐标数目的增加。",
          "section_id": "section_21b2600cae29",
          "start": 1023,
          "end": 1104,
          "chunk_start": 1023,
          "chunk_end": 1104,
          "sentence_document_start": 1023,
          "sentence_document_end": 1104,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_b1ae60607ef29d7fa1ca",
          "document_start": 1104,
          "document_end": 1125,
          "text": "通常的描述方法有：有限段方法和模态综合法。",
          "section_id": "section_21b2600cae29",
          "start": 1104,
          "end": 1125,
          "chunk_start": 1104,
          "chunk_end": 1125,
          "sentence_document_start": 1104,
          "sentence_document_end": 1125,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_ccf40e4a2b9e18b0dbe0",
          "document_start": 1125,
          "document_end": 1307,
          "text": "有限段方法将柔体典型化为具有一般横截面特征的三维柔体梁模型，各柔性梁可以离散化为有限个梁段，各段之间用3个扭簧、3个线簧和6个阻尼器连接，用离散的梁段描述柔体的惯性特征，用段间的弹簧和阻尼器代表柔体的弹性和阻尼特征，建立由段间相对角速率和体间相对（角）速度的广义速率的动力学方程，这种方法建模简单，概念清晰，但各单元被视为刚体，无法得到其本身变形，且只适合细长体；",
          "section_id": "section_21b2600cae29",
          "start": 1125,
          "end": 1307,
          "chunk_start": 1125,
          "chunk_end": 1307,
          "sentence_document_start": 1125,
          "sentence_document_end": 1307,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_a057896ff42105ecf256",
          "document_start": 1307,
          "document_end": 1381,
          "text": "模态综合法将柔体看作是有限元模型的节点的集合，其变形视为模态振型的线性叠加，相对于局部坐标系有小的线性变形，而此局部坐标做大的非线性整体平动和转动。",
          "section_id": "section_21b2600cae29",
          "start": 1307,
          "end": 1381,
          "chunk_start": 1307,
          "chunk_end": 1381,
          "sentence_document_start": 1307,
          "sentence_document_end": 1381,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_d9be39cb757c7dc6ca7a",
          "document_start": 1381,
          "document_end": 1448,
          "text": "每个节点的线性局部运动近似作为振型和振型向量的线性叠加，这种方法使得弹性广义坐标大大减少，方程阶数也大大降低，适合大规模多体系统分析。",
          "section_id": "section_21b2600cae29",
          "start": 1381,
          "end": 1448,
          "chunk_start": 1381,
          "chunk_end": 1448,
          "sentence_document_start": 1381,
          "sentence_document_end": 1448,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_acdcf8f31723fd390d75",
          "document_start": 1450,
          "document_end": 1470,
          "text": "[Source paragraph 5;",
